# Publish story (M5): this file is the SINGLE publish-exclusion mechanism.
# There is no "files" field in package.json, so the two can never conflict.
# npm publish runs from packages/, so the repo-root example/, docs/, and
# root README never enter the tarball in the first place. Inside packages/,
# everything ships except the unit tests below — including dist/ (built
# fresh by `npm run build` / prepublishOnly), src/ (the "react-native"
# field points Metro at src/index.ts, so RN apps keep bundling TS source
# exactly as before), ios/, android/, app.plugin.js, and the podspec.
src/__tests__/
